# Real trace — H4 supply discount + in-window thermal cap witness (F-10, EVAL-DONGHU-A §29.42.5)
#
# Golden sample donghu.ftrace, window 13762.791708..13763.024898 (233.190ms).
#
# HARD oracle (trace-recomputable, grep-checkable):
#   · running full-window total = 157.248ms — recomputed from the trace by
#     pairing every sched_switch next_pid=17267 → prev_pid=17267 on the same
#     CPU across the whole window (65 on-CPU intervals, first switch-in is
#     trace line 1 at 13762.791708); Σ = 157.248ms exactly.
#   · direct policy-limit witnesses — strict in-window
#     cpu_frequency_limits has cpu0 max=1530000/count=16/line=8048 and
#     cpu4 max=2100000/count=28/line=17113. The target has typed running
#     evidence on cpu4, so a policy-limit conclusion for that lane must bind
#     to the direct 2.10GHz max row; 558MHz actual/residency alone does not
#     prove the cap. cpu0/1.53GHz remains a valid bounded context witness but
#     is not allowed to stand in for the cpu4 answer.
#   · the four-state wall-clock account must be present in the model-authored
#     principal answer, not merely in the deterministic projection footer.
#   · NEGATIVE — the two-core-slice aggregation form 132.041 (§29.52.x CR-4
#     witness: model cross-caliber self-addition 96.081 cpu·ms + 35.960
#     per-CPU) must not appear: 132.041=0.
# SOFT oracle (verdict-judged):
#   · 四态账 Σ=窗: running+runnable+sleep+D-state sums to the analysis window
#     (233.190ms ± rendering rounding; raw switch-pair recomputation gives
#     running 157.248 + sleep 73.410 + runnable 1.994 with the residue on
#     boundary segments the engine accounts to the window edges).
#   · the direct max-limit sentence stays separate from actual/residency
#     frequency and transition-count activity.
ID="real_trace_h4_supply_thermal_witness"
NAME="real trace donghu — supply discount + thermal witness"
QUESTION="只分析这份 trace，不分析代码。请分析 .ugc.aweme.lite-17267 在 13762.791708s 到 13763.024898s 窗口内的 CPU 供给与运行占用：它在窗口内实际运行了多久？窗口内四种线程状态各占多少？它运行的 CPU 频率有没有受到限制，证据是什么？"
HTRACE_FILE="eval/fixtures/real_traces/donghu.ftrace"
# F4 seal (§29.55.5, EVAL-HYG 2026-07-14): trace-only case — --repo points at
# the sealed stub fixture instead of the codrax self-repo, so repository
# greps/reads cannot echo oracle witness strings (these .case files,
# real_traces/PROFILE.md and tracequery tests all carry them verbatim).
FIXTURE="eval/fixtures/stub_repo"
EXPECT_PRINCIPAL_CONTAINS="157.248 5.604 70.338"
EXPECT_PRINCIPAL_MATCHES_REGEX="([Rr]unning.{0,120}157\\.248|157\\.248.{0,120}[Rr]unning)
([Rr]unnable.{0,120}5\\.604|5\\.604.{0,120}[Rr]unnable)
(([Ss]_[Ss]leep|[Ss]leep|睡眠).{0,120}70\\.338|70\\.338.{0,120}([Ss]_[Ss]leep|[Ss]leep|睡眠))
(([Dd][-_ ]state|D 状态|不可中断).{0,120}(0\\.000|0 ?ms)|(^|[^0-9])(0\\.000|0 ?ms).{0,120}([Dd][-_ ]state|D 状态|不可中断))"
EXPECT_PRINCIPAL_MATCHES_TEXT_REGEX="((CPU ?=? ?4|cpu ?=? ?4).{0,240}(2\\.10 ?GHz|2\\.1 ?GHz|2100 ?MHz|2100000 ?kHz).{0,160}(上限|限制|限频|policy|limit|cap|maximum)|(CPU ?=? ?4|cpu ?=? ?4).{0,240}(上限|限制|限频|policy|limit|cap|maximum).{0,160}(2\\.10 ?GHz|2\\.1 ?GHz|2100 ?MHz|2100000 ?kHz))
((limit row|policy limit|策略上限|限制记录|限频记录).{0,160}(不能|不足以|无法|未证|unproven|requires).{0,120}(触顶|性能|影响|瓶颈|binding)|(触顶|性能|影响|瓶颈|binding).{0,160}(不能|不足以|无法|未证|unproven|requires).{0,120}(limit row|policy limit|策略上限|限制记录|限频记录))"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="132.041 still_present not_enough_evidence"
EXPECT_LOG_MATCHES_REGEX="phase=toolcall .*tool=trace_query"
